      {
        "id": "tb-matrix-api",
        "moduleId": "transformation-overview",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "两个入口函数与矩阵维度",
        "markdown": "OpenCV 把常用几何变换收敛到两个函数：`cv.warpAffine` 接收 $2 \\times 3$ 的变换矩阵，`cv.warpPerspective` 接收 $3 \\times 3$ 的变换矩阵。缩放、平移、旋转、仿射、透视这些具体变换，都可以理解为先求出对应的矩阵，再交给这两个函数执行。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000017"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "图像表示与基础处理",
                "Geometric Transformations of Images",
                "Transformations"
              ],
              "lineStart": 284,
              "lineEnd": 288,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "16fb1f37e181f617840e8352c637e49b3264875b8c58fdb751002cf7c849ffe7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-matrix-view",
        "moduleId": "transformation-overview",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：为什么是 2×3 与 3×3",
        "markdown": "模型补充，不是教材原文。\n\n二维点的仿射变换可写成 $\\begin{bmatrix} x' \\\\ y' \\end{bmatrix} = A \\begin{bmatrix} x \\\\ y \\end{bmatrix} + \\mathbf{t}$，其中 $A$ 是 $2 \\times 2$ 的线性部分、$\\mathbf{t}$ 是平移向量。把平移并入矩阵后得到 $2 \\times 3$ 形式，正好对应 `warpAffine` 的输入。透视变换还需要一个与坐标有关的缩放分母，矩阵因此多出一行，共 $3 \\times 3$，对应 `warpPerspective`。这解释了为什么两个函数的矩阵参数是固定维度，而不是任意大小。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-overview",
            "tb-matrix-api"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-scaling",
        "moduleId": "scaling",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "缩放与插值方法",
        "markdown": "缩放就是改变图像尺寸，OpenCV 用 `cv.resize()` 完成。尺寸可以手动指定目标大小，也可以给出缩放因子。教材给出的插值选择是：缩小优先 `cv.INTER_AREA`，放大优先 `cv.INTER_CUBIC`（较慢）或 `cv.INTER_LINEAR`；不特别指定时默认使用 `cv.INTER_LINEAR`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000018"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "图像表示与基础处理",
                "Geometric Transformations of Images",
                "Transformations",
                "Scaling"
              ],
              "lineStart": 289,
              "lineEnd": 310,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "8a9a131e902cb2b2f8695938bba97e863df704dc962f12cea40bf3f984496e8f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-scaling-decision",
        "moduleId": "scaling",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "补充：插值选择与尺寸参数",
        "markdown": "模型补充，用于把教材的选择规则变成可执行的判断。\n\n- 缩小图像：目标像素要汇总多个原像素，`INTER_AREA` 按区域平均，更接近“把细节合并”，不容易产生锯齿。\n- 放大图像：目标像素由周围原像素插值得到，`INTER_LINEAR` 速度快，`INTER_CUBIC` 用更大邻域、边缘更平滑但更慢。\n\n调用时两种写法等价：`cv.resize(img, None, fx=2, fy=2, interpolation=cv.INTER_CUBIC)` 用比例指定，`cv.resize(img, (2*width, 2*height), interpolation=cv.INTER_CUBIC)` 用目标尺寸指定。后者参数顺序是（宽, 高），而 `img.shape[:2]` 返回的是（高, 宽），需要交换后再传入。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-scaling"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-translation",
        "moduleId": "translation-rotation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "平移矩阵",
        "markdown": "平移是把目标整体挪动一个位置。若在 $x$、$y$ 方向上的位移为 $(t_x, t_y)$，则 $2 \\times 3$ 变换矩阵为\n\n$$M = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 0 & t_x \\\\ 0 & 1 & t_y \\end{bmatrix}$$\n\n把它写成 `np.float32` 数组后传给 `cv.warpAffine()`；例如位移 $(100, 50)$ 对应 `M = np.float32([[1,0,100],[0,1,50]])`。注意 `warpAffine` 的第三个参数是输出图像尺寸，形式为（宽, 高），即宽等于列数、高等于行数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000019"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "图像表示与基础处理",
                "Geometric Transformations of Images",
                "Transformations",
                "Translation"
              ],
              "lineStart": 311,
              "lineEnd": 344,
              "assetRefs": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opencv/opencv/6d381e029fe26248675f48b2d44df23f4f288d11/doc/py_tutorials/py_imgproc/py_geometric_transformations/images/translation.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "90ad6e3d698db66b79f856b27b0725c7081cf948e318eb523d2b1cf4caedde8a"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-translation-worked",
        "moduleId": "translation-rotation",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "补充：平移的坐标含义与越界",
        "markdown": "模型补充。平移矩阵把输入坐标 $(x, y)$ 映射为 $(x + t_x, y + t_y)$，它不修改像素值，只改变采样位置。\n\n若输出尺寸与原图相同，向正方向平移会让右侧和下方的目标移出画面，左上角出现没有原像素对应的区域；很多实现把这些位置填成常量（例如黑色）。这不是插值错误，而是变换后没有任何输入像素落在这些输出位置上。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-translation"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-rotation",
        "moduleId": "translation-rotation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "旋转矩阵与绕任意中心旋转",
        "markdown": "把图像旋转角度 $\\theta$，二维旋转矩阵为\n\n$$M = \\begin{bmatrix} \\cos\\theta & -\\sin\\theta \\\\ \\sin\\theta & \\cos\\theta \\end{bmatrix}$$\n\nOpenCV 还支持带缩放、且旋转中心可调的版本：\n\n$$\\begin{bmatrix} \\alpha & \\beta & (1-\\alpha)\\cdot center.x - \\beta\\cdot center.y \\\\ -\\beta & \\alpha & \\beta\\cdot center.x + (1-\\alpha)\\cdot center.y \\end{bmatrix}$$\n\n其中 $\\alpha = scale\\cdot\\cos\\theta$，$\\beta = scale\\cdot\\sin\\theta$。矩阵由 `cv.getRotationMatrix2D` 生成。教材示例以 $((cols-1)/2, (rows-1)/2)$ 为旋转中心，旋转 90 度且不缩放。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000020"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "图像表示与基础处理",
                "Geometric Transformations of Images",
                "Transformations",
                "Rotation"
              ],
              "lineStart": 345,
              "lineEnd": 374,
              "assetRefs": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opencv/opencv/6d381e029fe26248675f48b2d44df23f4f288d11/doc/py_tutorials/py_imgproc/py_geometric_transformations/images/rotation.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "1afb0768dc5e5fd983071ab56a6884c54a2392a3bf7b74a670520e19add6c44e"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-rotation-intuition",
        "moduleId": "translation-rotation",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：后两列在修正什么",
        "markdown": "模型补充。只看由 $\\alpha$、$\\beta$ 组成的 $2 \\times 2$ 部分，旋转是绕坐标原点进行的；一旦旋转中心不在原点，目标就会整体偏移。矩阵第三列的 $(1-\\alpha)\\cdot center.x - \\beta\\cdot center.y$ 与 $\\beta\\cdot center.x + (1-\\alpha)\\cdot center.y$，正是先把旋转中心平移到 `center`、转完再移回去所需的补偿量。旋转中心选错时，图像会看起来绕着画面外的某个点转动，而不是绕自身转动。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-rotation"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-affine",
        "moduleId": "affine",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "仿射变换：保持平行",
        "markdown": "仿射变换保持“原来的平行线在输出中仍然平行”。求解仿射矩阵需要三组对应点：输入图像中的三个点，以及它们在输出图像中的对应位置。`cv.getAffineTransform` 由此生成 $2 \\times 3$ 矩阵，再交给 `cv.warpAffine` 执行。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
